  "description": "Meguiar's Professional Pro Speed Polish M200 Extremely User Friendly Professional Car Polish for Removing Light Defects While Creating a High Gloss Finish, Easy - Distributed/Packaged by Meguiar'S. Product Details: Meguiar's Professional Pro Speed Polish M200 is an extremely user-friendly professional polish designed to clean and remove minor paint defects, while the surface leaves a swirl-free, deep, glossy finish even on dark and delicate paints. Developed for professional body shops and detailers, this advanced formula quickly removes light paint defects such as DA haze and rotary swivels and rounds off beautifully without creating further haze, swirls or holograms. The rich polishing oils enhance shine and shine for a brilliant finish, even when working on darker colors and varnishes that are more sensitive. This exclusive formula is safe and finely tuned for DA polishers with high and short stroke. M200 is also a versatile cleaning polish that is safe and effective when working by hand, dual action polisher with variable speed or rotation buffer on glossy color. It has been deliberately formulated to provide a long duty cycle and is low dust for quick cleaning. M200 is also the perfect final step to achieving a show car, swirl free result after using a more aggressive compound like Meguiar's Pro Speed Compound M100 to remove more severe paint defects.",
